{"id":"d537b31e66e4fbaf","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-rice.md","title":"Rice's Theorem","display":"thm-rice — Rice's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-rice","aliases":["88-thm-rice"],"display":"thm-rice — Rice's Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-rice-theorem]]","[[88-df-rice-property]]","[[88-df-index-set]]","[[88-df-partial-computable]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[88-thm-rice-proof]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-rice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-rice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rice — Rice's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"596739a9c86dafde\" href=\"?note=596739a9c86dafde\" title=\"88-df-rice-theorem\">88-df-rice-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8085e5127aec7739\" href=\"?note=8085e5127aec7739\" title=\"88-df-rice-property\">88-df-rice-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97c2d6a4b728542c\" href=\"?note=97c2d6a4b728542c\" title=\"88-df-index-set\">88-df-index-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b020503ba5d16dce\" href=\"?note=b020503ba5d16dce\" title=\"88-df-partial-computable\">88-df-partial-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4aed37dba54730e2\" href=\"?note=4aed37dba54730e2\" title=\"88-thm-rice-proof\">88-thm-rice-proof</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a> 的固定编号环境；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b020503ba5d16dce\" href=\"?note=b020503ba5d16dce\" title=\"88-df-partial-computable\">88-df-partial-computable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是其候选子类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8085e5127aec7739\" href=\"?note=8085e5127aec7739\" title=\"88-df-rice-property\">88-df-rice-property</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"97c2d6a4b728542c\" href=\"?note=97c2d6a4b728542c\" title=\"88-df-index-set\">88-df-index-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"596739a9c86dafde\" href=\"?note=596739a9c86dafde\" title=\"88-df-rice-theorem\">88-df-rice-theorem</a>。</li>\n<li>实际归约论证见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"4aed37dba54730e2\" href=\"?note=4aed37dba54730e2\" title=\"88-thm-rice-proof\">88-thm-rice-proof</a>，没有以不可判定性本身作为假设。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\to\n\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\to\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\to\n\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\to\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由 Rice 归约证明形式直接取结论。性质 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的元素是部分函数图，因此外延性由成员资格保证；非平凡性要求非空且不是全部函数类。不可判定的对象是该性质在所指定编号下的索引集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>可接受编号保证程序构造能统一翻译为总可计算的索引变换。现在这一环境前提写在定理中，与修正后的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 和递归定理一致，而不是悄悄把“有效满编号”当作已经具备所有编译性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-rice-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"596739a9c86dafde","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-rice-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-rice-property","status":"resolved","id":"8085e5127aec7739","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-rice-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"97c2d6a4b728542c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[